{
  "info": {
    "name": "Project Service - Project Management (Wizard)",
    "description": "Alur pembuatan project management end-to-end pada project-service (specs/003-project-management-e2e, fase 0-3).\n\nWizard steps: 1. Usulan Proyek Kolaborasi (POST/PUT /projects) -> 2. Tentukan Stage (PUT /projects/{project_id}/stages) -> 3. Tentukan Timeline (fase 4, belum tersedia) -> 4. Konfigurasi Setiap Stage (fase 5, belum tersedia) -> 5. Review & Activate (fase 6, belum tersedia).\n\nNavigasi antar step bebas; cek kelengkapan via GET /projects/{project_id}/setup-state.\n\nSemua endpoint admin, dilindungi JWT (Authorization: Bearer) + role super_admin/admin_pusat/admin_pustik.\n\nBase URL local dev: http://localhost:4076/project-service/api",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:4076/project-service/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "PASTE_JWT_TOKEN_ADMIN"
    },
    {
      "key": "project_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "workflow_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "client_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "category_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "pic_user_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "stage_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "task_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "deliverable_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "document_id",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "member_id",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Projects",
      "description": "Screen S1 Daftar Proyek + wizard step 1 (S2 Usulan Proyek Kolaborasi).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List proyek",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/projects",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "projects"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10",
                  "description": "optional - jumlah baris per halaman (Show N)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "search",
                  "value": "",
                  "description": "optional - cari title / project_no",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort_by",
                  "value": "updated_at",
                  "description": "optional - title | project_no | client | stage | progress | status | updated_at",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "sort_order",
                  "value": "desc",
                  "description": "optional - asc | desc",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "draft",
                  "description": "optional - draft | pending_approval | active | on_hold | completed | cancelled",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "client_id",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "optional - filter client",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "category_id",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "optional - filter kategori proyek",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "my",
                  "value": "true",
                  "description": "optional - true = hanya proyek milik saya (PIC / member)",
                  "disabled": true
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Daftar proyek (S1): Nama Project, Client, Stage (current_stage), Progress, Status."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buat proyek (step 1)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Development Mesin Giling\",\n    \"client_id\": 1,\n    \"partner_id\": null,\n    \"category_id\": 1,\n    \"pic_user_id\": 1,\n    \"target_end_date\": \"2026-09-30\",\n    \"budget\": 100000000,\n    \"description\": \"<p>Deskripsi proyek kolaborasi.</p>\",\n    \"attachments\": [\n        {\n            \"file_url\": \"https://files.example.com/Rencana_Project_2026.pdf\",\n            \"file_name\": \"Rencana_Project_2026.pdf\",\n            \"file_size_kb\": 1228\n        }\n    ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/projects",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "projects"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Wizard step 1 (S2 Usulan Proyek Kolaborasi). Membuat proyek status draft + project_no otomatis. Lampiran: pdf,doc,docx,jpg,jpeg,png, maks 5 file @ 5 MB (upload file-nya via file-service POST /upload, simpan URL di file_url)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Detail proyek",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/projects/{{project_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "projects",
                "{{project_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Detail proyek via project_id: relasi PM (client/partner/category/workflow/pic + email), stages, current_stage, attachments."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Update proyek (step 1)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"title\": \"Development Mesin Giling (Revisi)\",\n    \"target_end_date\": \"2026-10-31\",\n    \"budget\": 150000000,\n    \"description\": \"<p>Revisi target selesai.</p>\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/projects/{{project_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "projects",
                "{{project_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Update parsial step 1 (navigasi bebas, field yang dikirim saja yang berubah). Hapus lampiran via deleted_attachment_ids: [id]."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Setup state",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/projects/{{project_id}}/setup-state",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "projects",
                "{{project_id}}",
                "setup-state"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Kelengkapan wizard per step (1-4) + ready_to_activate + missing[] untuk navigasi bebas."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Hapus proyek",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/projects/{{project_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "projects",
                "{{project_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Hanya untuk proyek status draft (soft delete)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Stages",
      "description": "Wizard step 2 (S3 Tentukan Stage): gunakan workflow atau buat manual, tambah/ubah/hapus/susun ulang.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List stage",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/projects/{{project_id}}/stages",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "projects",
                "{{project_id}}",
                "stages"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Daftar stage proyek terurut sequence (tabel S3)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sync stage dari workflow",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"workflow_id\": 1,\n    \"stages\": [\n        {\n            \"workflow_stage_id\": 1,\n            \"name\": \"Requirement\",\n            \"sequence\": 1\n        },\n        {\n            \"workflow_stage_id\": 2,\n            \"name\": \"Feasibility\",\n            \"sequence\": 2,\n            \"allow_skip\": true\n        },\n        {\n            \"workflow_stage_id\": 3,\n            \"name\": \"Proposal\",\n            \"sequence\": 3\n        }\n    ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/projects/{{project_id}}/stages",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "projects",
                "{{project_id}}",
                "stages"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Tab 'Gunakan Workflow' (S3). Preview template via master-service GET /workflows/{id}/stages. Flag is_required/allow_skip/allow_repeat disalin dari template kecuali dioverride. Sequence cukup menentukan urutan (disimpan ulang 1..n)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sync stage manual",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"stages\": [\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Requirement\",\n            \"sequence\": 1\n        },\n        {\n            \"name\": \"Feasibility\",\n            \"sequence\": 2,\n            \"allow_skip\": true\n        }\n    ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/projects/{{project_id}}/stages",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "projects",
                "{{project_id}}",
                "stages"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Tab 'Buat Manual' (S3): stage tanpa workflow_stage_id. Edit = kirim ulang daftar lengkap dengan id (replace-all); sequence menentukan urutan baru; stage yang dihapus harus bebas dependency (422 bila masih dituju stage lain)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Sync stage: apply template ke satu stage",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{token}}"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/projects/{{project_id}}/stages/{{stage_id}}/apply-template",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "projects",
                "{{project_id}}",
                "stages",
                "{{stage_id}}",
                "apply-template"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Aksi 'Gunakan Workflow' pada Step 4 (S5): ganti description/flag/tasks/deliverables stage dari blueprint (snapshot; baris lama soft-delete). Nama, tanggal, PIC, approver dipertahankan — kecuali template mematikan requires_approval. Body kosong = pakai workflow_stage_id milik stage. 422 untuk stage manual tanpa template.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"workflow_stage_id\": null\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Timeline",
      "description": "Wizard step 3 (S4 Tentukan Timeline): periode proyek, tanggal per stage, dependency opsional.",
      "item": [
        {
