              "path": [
                "projects",
                "{{project_id}}",
                "timeline"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Periode proyek + tanggal/dependency per stage. Durasi dihitung inklusif (end - start + 1 hari). 422 bila: end < start, stage di luar periode proyek, self-ref/siklus dependency, atau dependency mulai lebih akhir.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"start_date\": \"2026-06-01\",\n    \"target_end_date\": \"2026-09-30\",\n    \"stages\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": 1,\n            \"start_date\": \"2026-06-03\",\n            \"end_date\": \"2026-06-09\"\n        },\n        {\n            \"id\": 2,\n            \"start_date\": \"2026-06-10\",\n            \"end_date\": \"2026-06-16\",\n            \"depends_on_project_stage_id\": 1\n        }\n    ]\n}",
